WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.413
Once upon a time, there was a clever boy.

2
00:00:11.414 --> 00:00:20.748
His name was Jack.

3
00:00:20.749 --> 00:00:23.205
He lived with his mother.

4
00:00:23.206 --> 00:00:28.442
Jack and his mother were poor.

5
00:00:28.443 --> 00:00:33.700
Long ago an evil ogre stole their gold.

6
00:00:33.701 --> 00:00:38.408
Then Jack's father died.

7
00:00:38.409 --> 00:00:42.668
But they still had a garden and wheat field.

8
00:00:42.669 --> 00:00:48.602
They also had an old cow named Milky White.

9
00:00:48.603 --> 00:00:53.334
Every morning Jack milked Milky White.

10
00:00:53.335 --> 00:00:56.504
Every afternoon he went to the market.

11
00:00:56.505 --> 00:01:03.672
"Fresh milk for sale!" Jack called. "Fresh butter too!"

12
00:01:03.673 --> 00:01:13.898
Every night Jack took the money home to Mother.

13
00:01:13.899 --> 00:01:22.018
One year terrible rainstorms came.

14
00:01:22.019 --> 00:01:25.983
Rain washed away their vegetable garden.

15
00:01:25.984 --> 00:01:30.202
It washed away the wheat field too.

16
00:01:30.203 --> 00:01:33.279
Mother looked around and shook her head.

17
00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:40.579
"What will we do?" she said.

18
00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:45.542
"Don't worry, Mother," Jack said cheerfully.

19
00:01:45.543 --> 00:01:48.969
"In the spring we'll make a new garden.

20
00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:53.152
We'll plant more wheat.

21
00:01:53.153 --> 00:01:56.611
And we still have Milky White."

22
00:01:56.612 --> 00:02:00.653
Mother nodded. "You're right, Jack.

23
00:02:00.654 --> 00:02:05.114
We still have Milky White."

24
00:02:05.115 --> 00:02:10.191
Then one day Jack went to milk the cow.

25
00:02:10.192 --> 00:02:13.476
But Milky White had no milk.

26
00:02:13.477 --> 00:02:19.957
"I hope Milky White is okay," Jack thought.

27
00:02:19.958 --> 00:02:24.695
The next day Jack tried to milk the cow again.

28
00:02:24.696 --> 00:02:28.418
"Oh no!" he said.

29
00:02:28.419 --> 00:02:32.839
The cow had no milk again.

30
00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:41.554
Jack sighed. "How will I tell Mother?"

